  "body": "A fresh session proposes to occupy the og-strategist seat, which is already status: staffed (incumbent og-strategist <og-strategist@ogframework.com>, staffed 2026-05-23). Per the seat-vs-incumbent pattern the seat persists while sessions are ephemeral, so this is a resumption -- no charter status/incumbent edit is required. The authorization gate is honored regardless: propose -> authorize -> operate. /og-orient was run first (read-only); no seat work performed. Fit evaluated as strong: scope (OG pattern-shape design decisions, pattern-promotion calls, MUST/SHOULD curation, canonical og- skill content authority, cross-runtime delivery prioritization, adoption-cycle architecture) matches capabilities. Three mismatches named rather than papered over: (1) ~10 weeks have passed since the 2026-06-15 session, so every 'do X' in memos/ is a point-in-time record, not a live instruction -- currency to be verified with the Director before acting; (2) promotion pressure is this seat's standing failure mode, and v1 criterion (d) (one non-spec real-org adopter) remains unmet, so pattern #8 promotion-follows-adoption is to be held, not cleared; (3) no continuity claim -- nothing beyond the substrate is known, and ambiguity will be surfaced rather than reconstructed. Bounds named: no merge/push/tag/release/public statement; no format-shape decisions (route out to the relevant -def-spec strategist); no vendor or substrate advocacy; no charter version bump without ratification; embedded roledef:Job deferred per precedent; no content policing of, or infrastructure imposition on, adopter orgs. Open strategist-scope items inherited: doorbell promotion watch (vendor-neutral transport authorized but unbuilt -- the single gate on conformance #3); pattern-promotion watch-list (thingalog AI-PM seat, three-tier permission composition, seat-capability-manifest) to revisit not re-decide; canonical-orgs library residence reply owed to orgdef-strategist since 2026-05-24-0900; Caliper local-conventions work; record hygiene (six untracked memos, two modified transcripts, unignored .wrangler/). Record correction: main is in sync with origin/main -- the 2026-06-15 doorbell work WAS pushed, contrary to that session's closeout assumption. Awaiting explicit authorization ('take the seat' / 'yes, occupy og-strategist'); the PO may decline or redirect. AUTHORIZATION 2026-08-24: Director granted ('Take the seat'). Seat occupied for this session; no charter edit made (already staffed under the persistent identity; seat-vs-incumbent resumption, matching the 2026-06-14 implementer precedent); this memo stands as the institutional record of the occupation. action_required flipped to false on authorization.",
